[l_english.MODULE_ARMOR_2B_STEEL]
Steel Armor

[l_english.MODULE_ARMOR_2B_STEEL_desc]
While you are in a steel tank laughing at your enemies’ wooden tank burning in flame, they are also laughing at your tank slowly rusting and sinking into the swamp.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_ARMOR_2B_STEEL]
铁制装甲

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_ARMOR_2B_STEEL_desc]
当你在钢铁坦克里嘲笑敌人的木制坦克被火焰焚烧时，他们也在嘲笑你的坦克慢慢生锈并沉入沼泽。
